{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32244","headline":"题崔公池旧游 · 温庭筠","name":"题崔公池旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎镜方塘菡萏秋，此来重见采莲舟。\n谁能不逐当年乐，还恐添成异日愁。\n红艳影多风嫋嫋，碧空云断水悠悠。\n檐前依旧青山色，尽日无人独上楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}